"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-qute_quarkus-qute-iteration-metadata-prefix]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-qute_quarkus-qute-iteration-metadata-prefix[`+++quarkus.qute.iteration-metadata-prefix+++`]##\n"
